# Where .github/workflows/ci.yml checks bw-board and bw-circuit-ui out so the
# cross-repo gates run instead of skipping, and where a developer reproducing a
# CI failure locally will put them. Two whole sibling repositories; not ours,
# never committed — and ignored by eslint too (eslint.config.js), because
# `eslint .` from the root otherwise lints 5.3 MB of two other repositories.
